    <div class="prose-page">
      <section>
        <p>These Terms of Service explain the rules for using WaterLevels.org.</p>
        <p>
          WaterLevels.org is operated by Bytoro LLC, a Washington limited liability company. In these terms, “WaterLevels.org,” “we,” “us,” and “our” refer to Bytoro LLC.
